<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22720" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-dēfessus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>unwearied</i>, <i>indefatigable</i>
				(<b>poet.</b> and post-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dextra,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 11, 651</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">agendo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					9, 199</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">assiduus et indefessus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac.
					A. 16, 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Germani ob prospera indefensi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 64</span></i>
			.— Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">indēfessē</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">indēfessim</span></b> , <i>advv.</i>, <i>unweariedly</i> (both post-class.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b> Form indefesse: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">et benigne agere omnia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aus. Grat. Act. 35</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Spart. Hel. 5, 10</span></i>.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b> Form indefessim: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">expetere bonorum amicitias,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 3, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Claud. Mam. Stat. Anim. 1,
		7</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
